        "id": "HecarimRapidSlash",
        "name": "Rampage",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Hecarim cleaves nearby enemies dealing physical damage. If Hecarim damages at least one enemy, he increases the damage and lowers the cooldown of subsequent Rampages.",
        "bodyHtml": "Hecarim cleaves nearby enemies for <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60/90/120/150/180 + (90% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. If this Ability hits, he gains a stack that decreases its Cooldown by 0.75 seconds and increases its damage by (3 + (3% bonus Attack Damage))for 8 seconds. Stacks up to 3 times.<br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals a base of <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(36/54/72/90/108 + (54% bonus Attack Damage)) damage</span> to minions.</span>",
