        "name": "Spirit of Dread",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Hecarim gains Armor and Magic Resist. Hecarim deals magic damage to nearby enemies, and gains Health equal to a percentage of any damage those enemies suffer.",
        "bodyHtml": "Hecarim deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/120/160/200/240 + (80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> over 4 seconds to nearby enemies. <br /><br />Hecarim gains <span>5/10/15/20/25</span> <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">Armor</span> and <span>Magic Resist</span> and heals for <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">25% of damage</span> nearby enemies take from Hecarim and <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">12.5% of damage</span> taken from his allies.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Hecarim cannot heal more than <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">120/150/180/210/240 Health</span> from minions or jungle monsters.</span>",
