        "name": "Devastating Charge",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Hecarim gains increasing Move Speed and can move through units for a short duration. His next attack knocks the target back and deals additional physical damage based on the distance he has traveled since activating the ability.",
        "bodyHtml": "Hecarim becomes Ghosted and gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">25% Move Speed</span> increasing to <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">65%</span> over 4 seconds. His next Attack <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Back</span> and deals between <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(30/45/60/75/90 + (50% bonus Attack Damage))</span> and <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60/90/120/150/180 + (100% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knock Back</span> distance and damage scales with distance travelled during this Ability.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Ghosted units ignore collision with other units.<br />The remaining duration of this Ability is paused during Onslaught of Shadows.<br />This Ability triggers spell effects upon dealing damage.</span>",
