        "summary": "Hecarim summons spectral riders and charges forward, dealing magic damage in a line. Hecarim creates a shockwave when he finishes his charge, causing nearby enemies to flee in terror.",
        "bodyHtml": "Hecarim summons spectral riders and charges forward, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + (100% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. Hecarim unleashes a shockwave at the end of the charge that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Fears</span> for between 0.75 to 1.5 seconds, increased by charge distance.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Hecarim will move to the targeted location, but the riders always move the full distance.</span>",
